---
import MarkdownPageLayout from '../layouts/MarkdownPageLayout.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
---
<MarkdownPageLayout title="Privacy" description="How this site measures usage and remembers your theme." kicker="ANDRE LUSTOSA / PRIVACY">
  <h2>Site analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/">GoatCounter</a> to
    understand which pages people read and where visits come from. The tracker
    runs on alustos.us, not in local development or draft previews.
  </p>
  <p>
    GoatCounter receives pageview and referrer information and can derive browser,
    device, language, screen-size, and approximate location statistics. Its
    documented default is aggregate reporting without tracking cookies or
    persistent visitor identifiers. It temporarily processes IP addresses and
    browser information to distinguish visits. See{' '}
    <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/help/privacy">GoatCounter’s privacy policy</a>{' '}
    for processing and retention details.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site works when analytics is blocked or JavaScript is disabled. The
    integration does not add session recording or advertising trackers.
  </p>
  <h2>Theme preference</h2>
  <p>
    Choosing a light or dark theme saves that preference in your browser’s local
    storage. You can remove it by clearing this site’s browser data.
  </p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Andre Lustosa</a>.</p>
</MarkdownPageLayout>
